response.text:
```openui lifecycle=ephemeral id=area-perimeter-sim
root = LearningSurface([sim], "Area vs. Perimeter", "Watch how changing the width affects area and perimeter when the height is fixed at 4.", "ephemeral")
sim = Simulation("rect-sim", "Rectangle Dimensions", 
  [
    { id: "width", label: "Width", min: 1, max: 10, step: 1, value: 5 }
  ],
  [
    { id: "area", label: "Area", unit: "sq units", expr: "width * 4", emphasis: true },
    { id: "perimeter", label: "Perimeter", unit: "units", expr: "(width + 4) * 2" }
  ],
  "ephemeral",
  "Predict what happens to the area and perimeter if you double the width from 5 to 10. Then, move the slider and see if your prediction matches."
)
```

